-- DB update 2026_09_05_38 -> 2026_09_27_00
-- Class trainer baseline (2026-09-26): trainers 200-217 and the class-trainer NPCs pointing at them,
-- taken over from mod-progression so trainers never change with the progression phase. mod-progression's
-- phase_00 created this layout (it ran once, 2026-09-02); its phase_00/07/13 trainer SQL is deleted from
-- the module. This is a snapshot of the live DB, i.e. phase_00 plus every trainer change the class
-- reworks have made since (old spell ranks removed, new single-rank spells added), so it reproduces the
-- live state on a fresh DB and is a no-op on the live one.
-- Load order: it must apply BEFORE the generated apps/dbc-tools migrations that follow it (its DELETE of
-- trainers 200-217 would otherwise wipe their trainer_spell rows) - keep that when promoting to db_world/.

